+\subsection{Threats to validity}
+\textbf{Internal:} conflicting duplicate annotations remain; validation is reused
+for stopping and threshold selection, and ablations are exploratory.
+\textbf{Construct:} sparse missing-concept labels are not a full measure of
+knowledge; target-associated concepts are assumed known.
+\textbf{External:} six students, one prompt and one LLM limit generalization;
+LOSO does not show a B advantage.
+
+\section{AI Usage}
+Gemini was the offline process analyzer. Codex and Claude helped write the code and
+structure the final report. Codex also helped implement, test and evaluate the
+revisions. Reported results come from the saved experiments with cached features.
